#*
  Base URLs of the RGD resources these templates link to.  This is the one place
  they are spelled out - every template takes its value from here.

  The Solr browse UI is served from two servers:
    - dev, where rgdweb.war and rgdCuration are deployed on the same host, so a
      relative URL resolves
    - ontomate, which serves Solr only and must point at the production webapps

  Each value can be overridden per server by a system property on the Solr JVM,
  plumbed through the "invariants" of the /browse handler in solrconfig.xml:

    -Drgdweb.url=/rgdweb
    -DrgdCuration.url=/rgdCuration
    -Dsolr.base.url=https://dev.rgd.mcw.edu/solr

  They are invariants rather than defaults so that a client cannot inject its own
  value through a query parameter and rewrite every link on the rendered page.
  When a property is unset - or a template is rendered through a handler that does
  not pin the invariants - the defaults below apply.
*#
## Base URL of rgdweb.war, no trailing slash.  Defaults to the absolute production
## URL because that one is valid from either server.
#if($request.params.get("rgdWebUrl") && $request.params.get("rgdWebUrl") != "")
#set($rgdWebUrl = $request.params.get("rgdWebUrl"))
#else
#set($rgdWebUrl = "https://rgd.mcw.edu/rgdweb")
#end
##
## Base URL of the rgdCuration webapp, no trailing slash.  Same reasoning.
#if($request.params.get("rgdCurationUrl") && $request.params.get("rgdCurationUrl") != "")
#set($rgdCurationUrl = $request.params.get("rgdCurationUrl"))
#else
#set($rgdCurationUrl = "https://rgd.mcw.edu/rgdCuration")
#end
##
## Base URL of this Solr server, no trailing slash.  Used both for browser-side
## lookups against the OntoSolr core and for server-side $import.read calls, which
## need an absolute URL.  Every server must point at its own Solr, so there is no
## value that is correct everywhere - set solr.base.url on each one.
#if($request.params.get("solrUrl") && $request.params.get("solrUrl") != "")
#set($solrUrl = $request.params.get("solrUrl"))
#else
#set($solrUrl = "https://ontomate.rgd.mcw.edu/solr")
#end
